{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Environmental News", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Global Crisis", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 17, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe events in the news in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Discussing How to Deal With Problems", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "<p>When you want to offer advice or give solutions to a problem, you use modals like <span class=\"italic\">might</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">could</span>.</p><p>You use the first conditional sentences with If clauses to talk about real possibilities in the future.</p><p>You use the second conditional to talk about unreal or imaginary (hypothetical) situations in the future.</p>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The modals can go at the beginning of the sentence, or after a clause starting with \u201c<span class=\"italic\">If ...</span>\u201d", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">If ... , I would/I wouldn't ...</span> <br/><span class=\"italic\">If ... , you could / should ...</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the First Conditional to say it's possible that you will do or not do something. In that condition, something else may, will or will not happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The parts of the sentence are divided into two clauses: the <span class=\"italic\">If</span> clause and the <span class=\"italic\">Condition</span> clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the Second Conditional to talk about unreal or hypothetical situations. You're not certain that it's possible to fulfill the condition.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">If I had a million dollars, I would travel around the world.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Do you have a million dollars?  No. <br/>Is it possible to suddenly get a million dollars? Not really.<br/>What would you do if you had a million dollars? Travel around the world.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use<span class=\"italic\"> if</span> + <span class=\"italic\">the Simple Past</span>, then <span class=\"italic\">would</span></span> in the result clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: What would happen if we didn't do anything about this?<br><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: The consequences would be disastrous if we didn't change our behavior.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Asking for Help or Advice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " There are several ways to ask for help or advice in English. You can use polite and casual language to do this. Let's look at one particular structure for asking for help or advice.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<p>You can use the structure: <br/><span class=\"italics\"><span class=\"italic\">Can</span> / <span class=\"italic\">Could</span> / <span class=\"italic\">Do</span> + <span class=\"italic\">you</span> + verb + <span class=\"italic\">me</span> (optional) + question word</span></p>Examples: <br/><span class=\"italic\">Could you explain to us how the weather patterns have been changing recently?<br/>Can you tell us what causes these changes?<br/>Do you know what we should do to avoid this scenario?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":5,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can</span> / <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could</span> / <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Do</span></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong italic\\\">you</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">verb</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">(<span class=\\\"italic\\\">me</span>/<span class=\\\"italic\\\">us</span>)</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">question word</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">you </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">tell</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">us</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">what</span> causes these changes?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">you </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">explain to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">us</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">how</span> the weather patterns have been changing recently?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Do</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">you </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">know</span>\\\"}\",\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">what</span> we should do to avoid this scenario?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "weather pattern", "type": "name"}, {"content": "weather conditions that repeat themselves on a regular, predictable basis", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The weather patterns have been changing recently.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear in a conversation about extreme weather conditions.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to tackle", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to make an effort to deal with something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Our refusal to tackle the problem of carbon gas emissions has not helped the situation.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hurricane", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a storm with violent winds, usually coming from tropical areas", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Hurricanes have caused great damage to coastal areas.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to wreak havoc", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to cause great damage; to cause chaos", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Hurricanes have been wreaking havoc on the coastal areas.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "marshland", "type": "name"}, {"content": "land consisting of low-lying wet areas", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Flash floods have been affecting the marshlands.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "disastrous", "type": "name"}, {"content": "causing great damage; catastrophic", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The consequences would be disastrous if we didn't change our behavior.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to urge", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to persuade, encourage or strongly advise ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I would urge everyone to be aware of the waste they produce every day and try to reduce it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le17ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Brainstorm ideas on how to make the environment in your city better. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down your ideas. Use modals of suggestion with conditionals to make sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Then go on the Internet or cut out pictures from magazines in order to make a poster for all of your suggestions. (Find at least 8 to 10 pictures)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Hang your posters on a wall and present your ideas to your classmates using suggestions.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about the environment.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss how to deal with problems. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for help or advice. ", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about extreme weather conditions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss how to deal with problems. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for help or advice. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How different is the weather now compared to when you were a child?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What do you do to keep updated about the weather? Go online? Watch the news?", "type": "Free Header