meland</span>: Our refusal to tackle the problem of carbon gas emissions has not helped the situation. The earth is simply finding it harder and harder to breathe!", "id": 2, "time": "27000", "image": "engenn7le17ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-100\">Sally</span>: What would happen if we didn't do anything about this?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Brock Tameland</span>: The consequences would be disastrous if we didn't change our behavior. We are facing a global crisis: harsh winters and scorching summers every year, insufficient crops ...", "id": 3, "time": "39000", "image": "engenn7le17ob09re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong prelo-dialogue-100\">Sally</span>: That sounds terrifying. Do you know what we should do to avoid this scenario?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Brock Tameland</span>: I would urge everyone to be aware of the waste they produce every day and try to reduce it. People should reuse what they have and recycle what they don't need instead of throwing everything away. That would be a good place to start.", "id": 4, "time": "55500", "image": "engenn7le17ob09re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le17ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le17ob09re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}